{"turn_id": "d30-t1", "session_id": "d30", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "onion_satirical_corpus", "text": "The paper's satirical corpus consists of 9,159 headlines published by the satirical newspaper The Onion.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1901.03253", "chunk_id": "c-188a871a6da3d11b36702382"}]}, {"key": "serious_corpus", "text": "The serious corpus consists of 9,000 headlines drawn from 9 major news websites.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1901.03253", "chunk_id": "c-188a871a6da3d11b36702382"}]}, {"key": "chunking_onion", "text": "The authors chunked all 9,159 original headlines from their The Onion corpus.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1901.03253", "chunk_id": "c-279178dcc9e082109b5cb49c"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d30-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d30-t2", "session_id": "d30", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "onion_corpus_size", "text": "该论文的讽刺语料库由讽刺报纸 The Onion 发表的 9,159 条标题组成。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1901.03253", "chunk_id": "c-188a871a6da3d11b36702382"}]}, {"key": "serious_corpus_size", "text": "论文的严肃语料库由来自 9 个主要新闻网站的 9,000 条标题组成。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1901.03253", "chunk_id": "c-188a871a6da3d11b36702382"}]}, {"key": "corpus_requirement", "text": "该游戏需要讽刺性新闻标题语料库与严肃新闻标题语料库作为输入。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1901.03253", "chunk_id": "c-188a871a6da3d11b36702382"}]}, {"key": "chunking_process", "text": "作者使用 OpenNLP 的最大熵组块器（浅层解析器），在针对简练的标题风格文本重新训练后，对 POS 标注文本进行组块，将相邻的词元分组成短语（chunks）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1901.03253", "chunk_id": "c-279178dcc9e082109b5cb49c"}]}, {"key": "chunking_all_headlines", "text": "作者对来自 The Onion 语料库的全部 9,159 条原始标题进行了组块处理，发现最常见的组块模式是 NP VP NP PP NP（4.8%），其次是 NP VP NP（4.3%）和 NP VP PP NP（3.3%）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1901.03253", "chunk_id": "c-279178dcc9e082109b5cb49c"}]}, {"key": "reverse_crowdsourcing", "text": "论文采用逆向众包方法：通过小幅度编辑去除讽刺标题中的幽默，将其改写成看似严肃的标题，这比从头创作讽刺标题所需的创造力更少。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1901.03253", "chunk_id": "c-5892e58ce4dcf31d0605c1ef"}]}, {"key": "onion_acceptance_rate", "text": "在 The Onion（美国最著名的讽刺报纸），每周生成的 600 条标题中仅有 16 条（不到 3%）被采用。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1901.03253", "chunk_id": "c-5892e58ce4dcf31d0605c1ef"}]}, {"key": "onion_running_example", "text": "将讽刺标题“God diagnosed with bipolar disorder”（发表于 The Onion）中的 God 改为 Bob Dylan，就得到一条可能原样出现在严肃报纸上的标题。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1901.03253", "chunk_id": "c-08a90544401173f481c068d2"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d30-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
